{"unit_id":"WNLUO__dsh-mobile-plugin#feature-1","repo":"WNLUO/dsh-mobile-plugin","commit":"1441c179423dcb201675118dbfac0316b6ffcac0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile Plugin 的功能「移动端会话」：手机可读取会话并创建、继续、重命名、分支、搜索和流式查看会话内容；通过对应的移动端会话 API 操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/routes/mobile-api.js:391-398","lib/routes/mobile-api.js:360-363"]}
{"unit_id":"WNLUO__dsh-mobile-plugin#feature-2","repo":"WNLUO/dsh-mobile-plugin","commit":"1441c179423dcb201675118dbfac0316b6ffcac0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile Plugin 的功能「工作区管理」：手机可读取目录并创建、重命名、移动或删除工作区，也能归档和置顶会话；操作通过移动 API 路由触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/routes/mobile-api.js:398-416","lib/routes/mobile-api.js:420-423"]}
{"unit_id":"WNLUO__dsh-mobile-plugin#feature-3","repo":"WNLUO/dsh-mobile-plugin","commit":"1441c179423dcb201675118dbfac0316b6ffcac0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile Plugin 的功能「手机配对」：手机向宿主提交配对请求，配对通过后取得设备凭据和宿主连接地址；配对信息由插件的配对处理器提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/mobile/pairing.js:108-109","lib/mobile/pairing.js:208-240"]}
{"unit_id":"WNLUO__dsh-mobile-plugin#feature-4","repo":"WNLUO/dsh-mobile-plugin","commit":"1441c179423dcb201675118dbfac0316b6ffcac0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile Plugin 的功能「中转隧道连接」：宿主通过 WebSocket 隧道连接配置的中转服务，并将转发请求接到本机 DSH Web 服务；适用于手机不在同一局域网的连接场景。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/relay/tunnel.js:1-14","lib/relay/tunnel.js:70-95"]}
{"unit_id":"WNLUO__dsh-mobile-plugin#feature-5","repo":"WNLUO/dsh-mobile-plugin","commit":"1441c179423dcb201675118dbfac0316b6ffcac0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile Plugin 的功能「局域网直连」：插件提供局域网 HTTP 与 WebSocket 代理，并生成供手机选择的连接地址；手机和宿主可在同一网络中直接连接。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/impl.js:305-307","lib/relay/lan-proxy.js:753-755"]}
{"unit_id":"WNLUO__dsh-mobile-plugin#feature-6","repo":"WNLUO/dsh-mobile-plugin","commit":"1441c179423dcb201675118dbfac0316b6ffcac0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile Plugin 的功能「无头 Host」：仓库提供独立 host.js 入口，启动 DSH Web 组合并加载移动 API，适合在没有桌面 UI 的服务器上运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:43-46","host.js:232-240"]}
{"unit_id":"WNLUO__dsh-mobile-plugin#feature-7","repo":"WNLUO/dsh-mobile-plugin","commit":"1441c179423dcb201675118dbfac0316b6ffcac0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile Plugin 的功能「连接控制面板」：网页面板读取宿主连接状态并允许启停远程控制、重连和保存 relay 或局域网配置；面板请求转发到宿主控制接口。","source":"generated","evidence":["React/src/App.tsx:68-84","React/src/App.tsx:131-180"]}
